{"person":"person:canon:youtanzhi","as_name":"铁丑","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":"place:canon:duanfugong","believed_by":[],"b":"text","ev":[[28,79,25,37,"0869d8eccaab7619"]],"tag":"text","note":"阿紫替他取的称呼，要他听到就答应；此后契丹人与阿紫都这样叫他"}
{"person":"person:canon:youtanzhi","as_name":"高昌国铁头人","kind":"false_identity","when":null,"where":"place:canon:duanfugong","believed_by":["person:canon:qiaofeng"],"ch":[28,28],"b":"text","ev":[[28,104,95,108,"2514257f4fa419dc"],[28,109,30,41,"12672f53adc035e4"],[28,64,39,46,"6c1952bfa5f1ac2c"]],"tag":"text","note":"阿紫对萧峰谎称他是外邦进贡的天生异貌者，铁面是其父母所造；萧峰信以为真，还替他拦下揭面之举，没认出他是游坦之"}
